{"id": "EUVD-2026-102988", "enisaUuid": "2a92d29d-dc0a-3c20-9a97-b1b4006f56cd", "description": "HUIZHI ChargeOS cloud through 3.0.9 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability in the hcp-mp MeController and OrderController that trusts client-supplied userId, openId and orderNumber parameters. Attackers can enumerate sequential member ids against endpoints like /me/getMemberBalanceByUserId and /order/orderDetail to read any member's wallet, credit, profile and charging orders.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:51", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T18:15:00", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/huizhi-chargeos-mp-member-api-userid-idor", "https://github.com/roinli/HUIZHI-ChargeOS-cloud/blob/1a2cbab79bb7abe7df3b4f9977f5d0e18e65bd4a/hcp-modules/hcp-mp/src/main/java/com/hcp/mp/controller/MeController.java#L40-L91", "https://github.com/roinli/HUIZHI-ChargeOS-cloud/blob/1a2cbab79bb7abe7df3b4f9977f5d0e18e65bd4a/hcp-modules/hcp-mp/src/main/java/com/hcp/mp/controller/OrderController.java#L59-L87", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/huizhi-chargeos-cloud-through-3.0.9-idor-via-hcp-mp-member-and-order-apis"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7f2r-7vg5-f3wp", "CVE-2026-111697"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.39, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "cf105822-4acb-3239-a11f-04d8cc98d6c6", "product": {"name": "HUIZHI-ChargeOS-cloud", "vendor": {"name": "roinli"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.0.9"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "56293d40-2a1f-3ea7-98fb-ab38ed8acdb0", "vendor": {"name": "roinli"}}], "isExploited": false}